(6307680, 932889, 3585, '<td valign="top">Not my most typical shot. Just for the fun; as this picture looked totally uninteresting originally, inverted it gave to these brushes a sense of cosmic floatation. I guess the cheerful silliness of it all is what made it popular in this rather dull challenge. Thanks to all.<br/> <br/>I''m sure glad on the other hand that this will not end up on my profile page!</td>', 'Not my most typical shot. Just for the fun; as this picture looked totally uninteresting originally, inverted it gave to these brushes a sense of cosmic floatation. I guess the cheerful silliness of it all is what made it popular in this rather dull challenge. Thanks to all. I''m sure glad on the other hand that this will not end up on my profile page!', '2011-02-09 02:15:26.000000', NULL, 0),
