(6307722, 932352, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your HM, very well done.<br/>Interestingly <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=43774" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">KarenNfld</a> thought this was my shot, if there hadn''t been the teapot image, I had thought this was hers</td>', 'Congrats on your HM, very well done.Interestingly  KarenNfld thought this was my shot, if there hadn''t been the teapot image, I had thought this was hers', '2011-02-09 03:04:16.000000', NULL, 0),
