(6307732, 933191, 60868, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments. Indeed, it is a vacuum cleaner. The small thing in the middle of the image is some dust. I wanted to give the impression of the vacuum cleaner hunting the dust, hence the zoom blur. I forgot that vacuum cleaners come in different shapes and colors, and it may be difficult to recognize one in the image.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments. Indeed, it is a vacuum cleaner. The small thing in the middle of the image is some dust. I wanted to give the impression of the vacuum cleaner hunting the dust, hence the zoom blur. I forgot that vacuum cleaners come in different shapes and colors, and it may be difficult to recognize one in the image.', '2011-02-09 03:35:09.000000', NULL, 0),
